{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119238","id":3627076525,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7YMMut","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119238","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119238.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119238.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119238","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119238/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119238/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119238/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2fec3b542a45399247eb13f353e68c1d863c2f0e","number":119238,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Refactor & Feature - FileSystem Dock","user":{"login":"GibionMillak","id":62446430,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNDQ2NDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62446430?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GibionMillak","html_url":"https://github.com/GibionMillak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GibionMillak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GibionMillak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GibionMillak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GibionMillak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GibionMillak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GibionMillak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GibionMillak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GibionMillak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GibionMillak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"A deep refactor of Godot's FileSystem Dock.\r\n\r\nNew Features\r\nPer-button toolbar visibility (Editor Settings)\r\nTwo new flag-based editor settings let you choose exactly which toolbar buttons are visible in the FileSystem Dock:\r\n\r\nfilesystem/theme/general/toolbar_buttons\r\nCreate New\r\nOpen Folder (desktop only)\r\nSave All\r\nDisplay Mode toggle\r\n\r\n<img width=\"300\" height=\"178\" alt=\"top\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6a7f8ef3-1398-48c1-adb3-217ff40baa42\" />\r\n\r\nfilesystem/theme/file_list/toolbar_buttons\r\nFile List Display Mode\r\nFile List Position\r\n\r\n<img width=\"300\" height=\"178\" alt=\"top1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/93249b16-0b2d-420e-b6d4-fa52e95ab5e4\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"300\" height=\"178\" alt=\"top\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/abeb5a0f-738e-47d7-ac81-f46b5f09937b\" />\r\n\r\nLayout persisted in Editor Settings\r\nThree new enum editor settings replace hardcoded defaults and sync both ways — changing them in Editor Settings updates the dock live, and clicking the buttons in the dock writes back to the settings:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"902\" height=\"732\" alt=\"3\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0cce9e39-84ed-4559-9726-ad40caa734e5\" />\r\n\r\nRefactoring & Cleanup\r\nSignal renamed: display_mode_changed → layout_changed\r\nThe signal was already fired for display mode and file-list display mode changes, making the old name misleading. layout_changed correctly describes all three layout-affecting changes.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1797\" height=\"333\" alt=\"one\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2dd6b1cc-2a52-4a47-a063-1ea450fe1af9\" />\r\n<img width=\"300\" height=\"488\" alt=\"two\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/31bd40d1-bacc-4c3b-99a7-0eeed30fca71\" />\r\n<img width=\"300\" height=\"488\" alt=\"two2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7e3ee061-e888-418e-a944-3f5d3a046da5\" />\r\n<img width=\"300\" height=\"488\" alt=\"two3\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fa8755c0-8140-4abc-8efc-359d9528c26a\" />\r\n\r\nI made these changes because I find it a bit frustrating to keep clicking the left mouse button to add new folders or files.\r\nI also use the editor on my phone and felt it was too cluttered with so many buttons on the screen. So now it's possible to hide the buttons in the Editor Settings.\r\n\r\nNow we no longer need to repeatedly click a single button to change the mode... A single toggle button to show and hide the file list, and another button (only visible if the file list is visible) to control the position of the file list (vertical or horizontal).\r\n\r\nAll buttons can be hidden for more clean space...\r\n\r\nThe text on the main buttons is only visible when the FileSystem is in horizontal mode in the bottom panel.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived